{"schema":"learning-v2-theory.v1","lesson":9,"lang":"ru","title":"Что происходит сейчас","sections":[{"num":"01","title":"Что вы научитесь говорить","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"В уроке 6 вы говорили о том, что бывает регулярно: I work, she cooks. Теперь — о том, что происходит прямо сейчас, на ваших глазах: «я смотрю на птиц», «лёд тает», «она не пробует варенье», «молния работает?»."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am observing the birds.","translation":"Я наблюдаю за птицами.","hi":"am observing"},{"en":"The ice is melting.","translation":"Лёд тает.","hi":"is melting"},{"en":"She is not tasting the jam.","translation":"Она не пробует варенье.","hi":"is not tasting"},{"en":"Is the zipper working?","translation":"Молния работает?","hi":"Is"}]}]},{"num":"02","title":"Скрепка + действие с -ing","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Чтобы сказать, что происходит сейчас, берут знакомую скрепку am, is, are и добавляют к действию -ing: I am watching. Нужны обе части. Без скрепки (I watching) или без -ing (I am watch) фраза ломается."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"кто","accent":false},{"text":"am / is / are","accent":true},{"text":"действие + ing","accent":false}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am observing the birds.","translation":"Я наблюдаю за птицами.","hi":"am observing"},{"en":"She is watching a caterpillar.","translation":"Она смотрит на гусеницу.","hi":"is watching"},{"en":"They are using a magnifier.","translation":"Они пользуются лупой.","hi":"are using"},{"en":"I am knocking at the door.","translation":"Я стучу в дверь.","hi":"am knocking"},{"en":"A visitor is waiting.","translation":"Посетитель ждёт.","hi":"is waiting"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I observing the birds.","right":"I am observing the birds."},{"wrong":"I am observe the birds.","right":"I am observing the birds."},{"wrong":"She watching a caterpillar.","right":"She is watching a caterpillar."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"She","after":"watching a caterpillar.","options":["is","are","—"],"answer":"is","why":"Перед действием с -ing нужна скрепка, с she — is."}}]},{"num":"03","title":"Скрепка — та же, что в уроке 1","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Какая скрепка, решает «кто» — как в самом начале курса. I — am, he, she, it и одна вещь — is, you, we, they — are: I am sighing, the ice is melting, we are marching."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am sighing with relief.","translation":"Я вздыхаю с облегчением.","hi":"am"},{"en":"He is sneezing.","translation":"Он чихает.","hi":"is"},{"en":"The firefly is glowing now.","translation":"Светлячок сейчас светится.","hi":"is"},{"en":"We are marching.","translation":"Мы маршируем.","hi":"are"},{"en":"The leaves are whirling.","translation":"Листья кружатся.","hi":"are"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"The leaves is whirling.","right":"The leaves are whirling."},{"wrong":"We is marching.","right":"We are marching."}]}]},{"num":"04","title":"Как пишется -ing","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Обычно -ing просто добавляют: watch → watching. Если слово кончается на немое e, e убирают: make → making. Если на короткий гласный и одну согласную, согласную удваивают: clap → clapping, sit → sitting, hop → hopping."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am making my portfolio.","translation":"Я собираю своё портфолио.","hi":"making"},{"en":"I am sitting.","translation":"Я сижу.","hi":"sitting"},{"en":"I am submitting my work.","translation":"Я сдаю свою работу.","hi":"submitting"},{"en":"The sparrow is hopping.","translation":"Воробей прыгает.","hi":"hopping"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I am makeing my portfolio.","right":"I am making my portfolio."},{"wrong":"I am siting.","right":"I am sitting."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"I am","after":".","options":["siting","sitting","sit"],"answer":"sitting","why":"В sit короткий гласный и одна согласная, поэтому t удваивают."}}]},{"num":"05","title":"«Не» — not после скрепки","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"«Не» ставят туда же, куда и всегда, — сразу после скрепки: I am not guessing, she is not tasting the jam. Действие с -ing остаётся."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"кто","accent":false},{"text":"am / is / are","accent":true},{"text":"not","accent":true},{"text":"действие + ing","accent":false}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am not guessing.","translation":"Я не угадываю.","hi":"not"},{"en":"She is not tasting the jam.","translation":"Она не пробует варенье.","hi":"not"},{"en":"They are not looking.","translation":"Они не смотрят.","hi":"not"},{"en":"The wax is not melting.","translation":"Воск не тает.","hi":"not"},{"en":"The drummer is not marching.","translation":"Барабанщик не марширует.","hi":"not"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I not guessing.","right":"I am not guessing."},{"wrong":"She doesn't tasting the jam.","right":"She is not tasting the jam."},{"wrong":"They are not look.","right":"They are not looking."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"spot_slip","kind":"spot_slip","chips":["She","doesn't","tasting","the","jam"],"answerIndex":1,"hint":"Одно слово тут не на месте. Нажмите на него.","fix":"С -ing «не» — это is not: She is not tasting the jam."}}]},{"num":"06","title":"Вопрос: скрепка вперёд","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Вопрос строится как в уроке 2: скрепку ставят в начало. Is the ice melting? Are you inspecting the seam? Do и does здесь не нужны — их место в вопросах о привычках."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"Am / Is / Are","accent":true},{"text":"кто","accent":false},{"text":"действие + ing","accent":false},{"text":"?","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"Are you inspecting the seam?","translation":"Вы проверяете шов?","hi":"Are"},{"en":"Is she inspecting the lining?","translation":"Она проверяет подкладку?","hi":"Is"},{"en":"Is the zipper working?","translation":"Молния работает?","hi":"Is"},{"en":"Is he sighing?","translation":"Он вздыхает?","hi":"Is"},{"en":"Is the chocolate melting?","translation":"Шоколад тает?","hi":"Is"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"Do you inspecting the seam?","right":"Are you inspecting the seam?"},{"wrong":"The chocolate is melting?","right":"Is the chocolate melting?"}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"word_bank","kind":"word_bank","prompt":"Спросите: «Шоколад тает?»","answer":["Is","the","chocolate","melting"],"distractors":["Does","melt"]}}]},{"num":"07","title":"Сейчас — или обычно?","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"I wear a sweatshirt — «я ношу толстовку» (обычно, вообще). I am wearing a sweatshirt — «я сейчас в толстовке». По-русски часто звучит одинаково, а в английском это разные фразы. Спросите себя: это привычка или прямо сейчас?"},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I wear a sweatshirt.","translation":"Я ношу толстовку. *(обычно)*","hi":"wear"},{"en":"I am sweating.","translation":"Я сейчас потею.","hi":"am sweating"},{"en":"The firefly is glowing now.","translation":"Светлячок сейчас светится.","hi":"is glowing"}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"binary","kind":"binary","question":"Прямо сейчас лёд на ступеньках тает. Как сказать?","optionA":"The ice melts.","optionB":"The ice is melting.","correct":"B","explain":"Это происходит сейчас, поэтому is melting."}}]},{"num":"08","title":"Что-то происходит — и где","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"К фразе о том, что происходит, легко добавить, где: She is in the doorway. I am near the carousel. Это знакомая скрепка с местом — без -ing, потому что действия здесь нет."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"She is in the doorway.","translation":"Она в дверях.","hi":"is"},{"en":"I am near the carousel.","translation":"Я возле карусели.","hi":"am"},{"en":"She is murmuring to the baby.","translation":"Она шепчет что-то малышу.","hi":"is murmuring"},{"en":"My hands are trembling.","translation":"У меня дрожат руки.","hi":"are trembling"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I am being near the carousel.","right":"I am near the carousel."}]}]},{"num":"09","title":"Ошибки, которые делают почти все","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I observing the birds.","right":"I am observing the birds."},{"wrong":"I am observe the birds.","right":"I am observing the birds."},{"wrong":"The leaves is whirling.","right":"The leaves are whirling."},{"wrong":"I am siting.","right":"I am sitting."},{"wrong":"I am makeing my portfolio.","right":"I am making my portfolio."},{"wrong":"She doesn't tasting the jam.","right":"She is not tasting the jam."},{"wrong":"Do you inspecting the seam?","right":"Are you inspecting the seam?"}]},{"kind":"tip","text":"Две части всегда вместе: скрепка и -ing. Есть одна — ищите вторую. А do и does в эти фразы не берите."}]},{"num":"10","title":"Что взять с собой в практику","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Сейчас — am / is / are + действие с -ing. «Не» — not после скрепки. Вопрос — скрепку вперёд. Пишите внимательно: making, sitting, hopping. Привычка — как в уроке 6, без -ing."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"They are using a magnifier.","translation":"Они пользуются лупой.","hi":"are using"},{"en":"They are not looking.","translation":"Они не смотрят.","hi":"not"},{"en":"Is she inspecting the lining?","translation":"Она проверяет подкладку?","hi":"Is"},{"en":"I am submitting my work.","translation":"Я сдаю свою работу.","hi":"submitting"}]}]}],"sessionSection":{}}
